x; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4277778\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szVAj3XrnMOH0683NEibUtNLMibfAawAaxZJXGJCYfdyDdOOKAcstKsyCvDjVrW4ZweKgVktIK5fNrMJKNSQsjqQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">恒生指数现在的市盈率是8倍，2008年金融危机的最低点，恒生指数的市盈率是7.7倍。2016年有过一次大跌，恒生指数最低点是7.84倍，也就是说现在<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">恒生的估值基本处在最近20年的最低水平区域了</strong>。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">虽然技术面上还看不出来支撑在哪，但是纯按基本面看，就是历史大底附近了，每次都是这么过来的。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">今天深红利跌的比较多，我们可以看他跟沪深300的对比图，紫色的线就是沪深300，长期来看他是一直跑赢沪深300的，尤其是在牛市的时候。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3166667\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szVAj3XrnMOH0683NEibUtNLMibfAawAaxpcjG0DNWddiaWhdjib7ZIFRnUw2ibo9JYvWQW4YZOSKoAvgqsyINVNOBg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">而最近一年，他却比沪深300跌的多。深红利长期跑赢沪深300，但是短期因为市场大跌跑输了，<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\">这肯定是一个很好的进场机会</span></strong>。选基金也要选择长期收益很好，但是短期收益暂时不行的，而不是选择短期很火的明星基金。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4064815\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMOH0683NEibUtNLMibfAawAaxIm64c9DFZvdDyDiaRo6E9MukjsPUHwBzwReic7zB4hzG28qSD5coXRGw/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" align-items: center;display: flex;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;flex: 1 0 1px;letter-spacing: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" margin-top: 0.5em;margin-bottom: 0.5em; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(62, 62, 62);box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;flex: 0 1 auto;box-shadow: rgb(0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 0px;line-height: 0;padding-right: 5px;padding-left: 5px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"  transform: rotateZ(45deg);-webkit-transform: rotateZ(45deg);-moz-transform: rotateZ(45deg);-o-transform: rotateZ(45deg);box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\" text-align: center